+# Frozen historical test reference
+
+`frozen-sailor-impact.ts` is a byte-exact test-only historical copy of
+`apps/game-client/src/simulation/SailorImpactPhysics.ts` from outer commit
+`c331ffed29b4074c620c14517f18c5f78e310586`, captured before Task3 extraction.
+
+Original/copy: 12,236 bytes; SHA256
+`6228963c55ea245312fa713b6293ec7f5e1783902cc0ae2cf8e3d44881f9be9c`.
+
+Do not modernize this reference or copy new numeric-kernel logic into it. It
+provides an independent original-algorithm oracle for authored18-node
+freeflight, genuine above-water wave entry/buoyancy/sinking/expiry, and timing
+defect reproduction. The numeric production solver does not import this file.
+The existing root Three dependency is used only by this headless historical
+test fixture. No renderer dependency is added to physics-core production.
+
+The versioned helper makes those comparisons reproducible in a fresh checkout
+without private ignored `.superpowers` captures or workstation paths.
